# Serve a LoRA adapter on top of its base model with Ollama:
#   ollama create support-triage -f Modelfile
#   ollama run support-triage
# The adapter must have been trained on exactly this base model (same architecture and weights).
FROM llama3.2:1b
ADAPTER ./adapter
PARAMETER temperature 0
SYSTEM You triage support tickets for an enterprise portal. Reply with JSON only.
